# What `docker build` (and Cloud Build, for `gcloud run deploy --source .`) may read: only what
# the Dockerfile copies. Everything else is left out, so the phone app, the food data, the docs, the
# Git history and any new file at the root never reach the image (D-101).
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!apps/api
!packages/shared

# Never in the image, even inside the folders above: settings and secrets (.env, .env.local,
# .env.example too), keys, installed packages, and the tests.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/node_modules
**/coverage
**/*.test.ts
apps/api/test
